---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Terms of service" description="General terms for Homi services.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Terms of service</h1><p class="lead">General terms for using Homi applications and services.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content"><div class="container content-narrow">
    <h2>Licenses</h2><p>A license identifies the application, approved device, usage plan, and validity period. License files must not be copied to unapproved devices or modified.</p>
    <h2>Payments</h2><p>Payments are arranged directly with Homi. A paid license is issued or extended only after an administrator confirms receipt of payment.</p>
    <h2>Customer information</h2><p>Contact and device details are processed only as needed to manage activation and subscriptions. Customer accounts are not required.</p>
    <h2>Updates and support</h2><p>Updates and support may be separate services from a lifetime license, according to the agreed terms.</p>
    <h2>Store data</h2><p>License expiry must not delete the customer's local store data. Customers should maintain secure backups.</p>
    <p class="muted">This is an initial draft and requires final legal review before public launch.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
